# Normalize line endings.
#
# This project targets Windows / Android / HarmonyOS, and the source files are
# authored with LF. autocrlf=true on Windows would otherwise rewrite every text
# file to CRLF on checkout, which makes diffs noisy and breaks the "one repo,
# several platforms" promise.
#
#   * text=auto eol=lf   -> store LF in the repo, check out LF everywhere
#   binary               -> never touch these
#
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.a binary
*.jar binary

# Keep Windows script files CRLF so cmd.exe / PowerShell behave predictably
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
